# Track 2 focused (SEQ held, white key 2), SHIFT (SEL) + white key 2 opens
# its Track page: KNOB1 routes it to MIDI out (channel 2, silent here),
# KNOB2 to channel 5, KNOB1 back to Sound 1; KNOB3 mutes it and unmutes
# it. Playing throughout.
--button 0.03:SEQ
--button 0.05:PLAY/STOP
--button 0.10:SEQ:0.1
--key 0.12:2:100:0.01
--button 0.30:SEL:0.05
--key 0.32:2:100:0.01
--turn 0.60:KNOB1:1
--turn 1.00:KNOB2:3
--turn 1.40:KNOB1:-1
--turn 1.80:KNOB3:1
--turn 2.20:KNOB3:-1
